      "id": "666c9f19-3994-4364-b4c5-6710a13d4a2a",
      "name": "VO2 Max Routes",
      "description": {
        "content": "VO2 Max is a measure of the maximum volume of oxygen that an individual can use during intense exercise. See more details [here](https://support.ouraring.com/hc/en-us/articles/28336620578835-Cardio-Capacity-VO2-Max).",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
